{"data":{"id":"gRJyclop8GQ","slug":"avila-brothers","title":"Avila Brothers","artwork":null,"tracks":[{"id":"fmZu2Cp2YgY","slug":"big-jim-s-sonata","title":"Big Jim S Sonata"},{"id":"FmJaVl1-J4I","slug":"i-want-you","title":"I Want You"}]},"markers":[{"id":"ryHgp3Iiy8g","position":17,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Avila Brothers - I Want You","track":{"id":"FmJaVl1-J4I","path":"/artists/avila-brothers/tracks/i-want-you/","slug":"i-want-you","title":"I Want You","artist":{"slug":"avila-brothers","title":"Avila Brothers"},"artwork":"images/artists/avila-brothers/tracks/i-want-you.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"uvJZqSGqvgU","slug":"boilerroom-streaming-from-isolation-14","tags":[6,3],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/joekay/jboiler-room-streaming-from-isolation-14"},"state":"published","title":"Boilerroom - Joe Kay 4 hour Streaming from Isolation #14","artwork":null,"content":"Joe Kay appears on BoilerRoom Live Streaming from Isolation sessions.\n\n<!--more-->\n\n\n[Please support here if you can.](https://business.facebook.com/donate/219168332618496/)\n\nDuring the pandemic, tune into our new live series Streaming From Isolation. These broadcasts will stream from artists’ homes and private spaces, direct to our audience and without the need for interaction with production teams - as we practice social distancing to remove risk from our programming.\n\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":7200,"location":"US","published_at":"2020-04-10T20:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's 4 hour experiance","position":0}},{"id":"qJ0EsmiDDko","position":32,"timestamp":"00:48:37","rawTrack":"Avila Brothers - I Want You","track":{"id":"FmJaVl1-J4I","path":"/artists/avila-brothers/tracks/i-want-you/","slug":"i-want-you","title":"I Want You","artist":{"slug":"avila-brothers","title":"Avila Brothers"},"artwork":"images/artists/avila-brothers/tracks/i-want-you.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"dMXeoHoJK_o","slug":"513","tags":[5,6,3,6,15],"links":{"appleMusic":"https://music.apple.com/gb/station/episode-513/ra.1575395247","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-513"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #513 (Olea Takeover)","artwork":"images/episodes/soulection-radio-show-513.jpg","content":"Soulection’s own olea takes control of the show.\n<!--more-->\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":7200,"location":"US","published_at":"2021-07-10T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Session","position":0}},{"id":"zp1bCKiTmuo","position":43,"timestamp":"01:34:21","rawTrack":"Avila Brothers - I Want You","track":{"id":"FmJaVl1-J4I","path":"/artists/avila-brothers/tracks/i-want-you/","slug":"i-want-you","title":"I Want You","artist":{"slug":"avila-brothers","title":"Avila Brothers"},"artwork":"images/artists/avila-brothers/tracks/i-want-you.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"Z-Z5ZRjxz58","slug":"504","tags":[6,6,15],"links":{"appleMusic":"https://music.apple.com/gb/station/episode-504/ra.1565854482","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-504"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #504","artwork":"images/episodes/soulection-radio-show-504.png","content":"Vibrations inspired by Timbaland.\n<!--more-->\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":7200,"location":"US","published_at":"2021-05-08T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Session","position":0}},{"id":"btSODRReOck","position":42,"timestamp":"01:31:16","rawTrack":"Avila Brothers - I Want You","track":{"id":"FmJaVl1-J4I","path":"/artists/avila-brothers/tracks/i-want-you/","slug":"i-want-you","title":"I Want You","artist":{"slug":"avila-brothers","title":"Avila Brothers"},"artwork":"images/artists/avila-brothers/tracks/i-want-you.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"zOMAi1e9mK4","slug":"505","tags":[6,6,15],"links":{"appleMusic":"https://music.apple.com/gb/station/episode-505/ra.1566918949","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-505"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #505","artwork":"images/episodes/soulection-radio-show-505.png","content":"Nostalgic R&B classics blended with some new sounds.\n<!--more-->\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":7200,"location":"US","published_at":"2021-05-15T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Session","position":0}},{"id":"NUSJQ4ycMSs","position":36,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"avila brothers - i want you","track":{"id":"FmJaVl1-J4I","path":"/artists/avila-brothers/tracks/i-want-you/","slug":"i-want-you","title":"I Want You","artist":{"slug":"avila-brothers","title":"Avila Brothers"},"artwork":"images/artists/avila-brothers/tracks/i-want-you.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"9vaV0x1cIVc","slug":"152","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-152-w"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #152 w/ LIKE (Pac Div)","artwork":"/images/episodes/152.jpg","content":"\n\nDue to all the adversity we went through with this show we had [LIKE](https://soundcloud.com/callmelike) play music past the last hour and extend all the way for a total of 3 hours & 39 minutes. \n<!--more-->\n\nFrom the very first minute to the very end we were providing music that you never heard of or forgot about, configuring wires, figuring out audio issues, chopping it up about food, you name it. So much effort went into producing this show. We want to thank our brother LIKE for rolling through and blessing us with a proper DJ set, freestyle over Esta's beat, and talking to us about his experiences growing up and being in Pac Div. This man has traveled the world, played alongside the best in the game, and has also produced for/with the best (Kendrick, The Neptunes, ect). Joe Kay made sure to touch on topics that are very insightful. LIKE will be releasing with us on Soulection so stay tuned! \n\nFollow LIKE on [Twitter](https://twitter.com/Callmelike) | [Instagram](https://www.instagram.com/clearlyitslike/) | [Facebook](https://www.facebook.com/callmeLike/)\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":13189,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-11-16T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"LIKE's Set","position":1}},{"id":"keFDMeM-Eqo","position":10,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Avila Brothers - I Want You","track":{"id":"FmJaVl1-J4I","path":"/artists/avila-brothers/tracks/i-want-you/","slug":"i-want-you","title":"I Want You","artist":{"slug":"avila-brothers","title":"Avila Brothers"},"artwork":"images/artists/avila-brothers/tracks/i-want-you.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"AfbBMadJe6c","slug":"162","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-162"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #162","artwork":"/images/episodes/162.jpg","content":"Joe reaches out to the listeners for the People Choice\n\n<!--more-->\n\nComing off Grammy week connections and our 3 Year Anniversary we returned for yet another solid show. Our special guests who were scheduled for this show couldn't make it but Joe Kay brought out a variety of new and classic gems from the Soulection crates. This show was really engaging because Joe reached out to all the listeners and asked the audience what they wanted to hear via social media. It was amazing to see how many people were listening and how many people requested for a certain track. For the last hour and 1/2 you the people we're DJ'ing/selecting music! How amazing right? Try to tune in live next time. The live feelings is always better. We'll catch you next week at the same time. Spread this if you feel it because it really is strictly about the music. Stay tuned for our 3 Year Anniversary Party announcement on Monday (1/27/14).\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10811,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-01-18T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"KZgAzvswYSA","position":38